# Build output and installed deps of the generated packages.
#
# The generator writes its own .gitignore inside each package (node_modules/,
# out/), but its tsconfig actually emits to dist/ — so that one misses the build
# output. Those per-package files are generated artifacts and must not be
# hand-edited (see README.md), so the correction lives here instead.
node_modules/
dist/
out/
*.tsbuildinfo
